	RESERVE
	 
	 
	THIS SOURCE TIES UP BLOCKS WHERE
	TAPE DIAGNOSTIC PROGRAMS WILL
	WRITE WHEN THEY OPERATE.
	 
	SPECIFICALLY, TC12DAEX AND 
		SYSTEM EXERCISER
	WRITE IN BLKS 770--1027 IF I
	REMEMBER CORRECTLY.
	 
	OTHER TAPE DIAGNOSTICS MAY WRITE
	ELSEWHERE.  BEWARE-----
	 
	 
	 
	 
	 
	 
	 
	 
	 
	 
	 
	 
	 
			
					
				
				
				
				
				
				
				
	 
	 
	 
	 
	 
	 
	
